# Customer Ordering Activity Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Customer opens app]) --> AuthCheck{Logged in?}
    AuthCheck -- No --> Login[Login/Register]
    Login --> AuthCheck
    AuthCheck -- Yes --> BrowseMenu[Browse Menu\nGET /menu/categories\nGET /menu/items]
    
    BrowseMenu --> SelectItem[Select Item\nView details\nModifiers]
    SelectItem --> AddToCart[Add to Cart\nPOST /cart/items]
    
    AddToCart --> CartCheck{More items?}
    CartCheck -- Yes --> BrowseMenu
    CartCheck -- No --> ViewCart[View Cart\nGET /cart]
    
    ViewCart --> CartActions{Action}
    CartActions -- Update Qty --> UpdateQty[PUT /cart/items/{id}/quantity]
    UpdateQty --> ViewCart
    CartActions -- Remove Item --> RemoveItem[DELETE /cart/items/{id}]
    RemoveItem --> ViewCart
    CartActions -- Clear Cart --> ClearCart[DELETE /cart]
    ClearCart --> BrowseMenu
    CartActions -- Checkout --> Checkout[Proceed to Checkout]
    
    Checkout --> LoadQuote[Load Quote\nGET /cart/checkout/quote]
    LoadQuote --> AddressForm[Enter Delivery Address]
    
    AddressForm --> ValidateAddress{Valid?}
    ValidateAddress -- No --> AddressForm
    ValidateAddress -- Yes --> GenerateIdem[Generate Idempotency Key]
    
    GenerateIdem --> PlaceOrder[Place Order\nPOST /orders\n{idempotencyKey, address}]
    
    PlaceOrder --> OrderResult{Success?}
    OrderResult -- No: 409 Idempotent --> ShowExisting[Show Existing Order]
    OrderResult -- No: 400/401/409 --> ShowError[Show Error\nRetry]
    ShowError --> AddressForm
    OrderResult -- Yes: 201 --> OrderCreated[Order Created\nRedirect to /orders/{id}]
    
    OrderCreated --> OrderDetail[View Order Detail\nGET /orders/{id}]
    
    OrderDetail --> TrackOrder{Track Delivery?}
    TrackOrder -- Yes --> Tracking[Order Tracking\nGET /delivery/tracking/{id}]
    Tracking --> PollStatus{Poll for updates}
    PollStatus -- DELIVERED --> Done([Order Delivered])
    PollStatus -- Not delivered --> Tracking
    
    TrackOrder -- No --> History[Order History\nGET /orders]
    History --> Done
    
    Done --> End([End Session])
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5fe
    style End fill:#ffebee
    style OrderCreated fill:#e8f5e9
    style ShowError fill:#fff3e0
```